        "body": "Show multi-view: Show or hide the multi-view panel on the left to facilitate viewing images in different directions at the same time. Rotation options: Support no rotation, regular rotation and random rotation to meet fixed observation or automatic cruise needs. Normal Speed: Adjust the normal rotation speed from -1 to 5. General Parallel: Sets the horizontal angle limit from -180° to 180°. Random Speed: Controls the random rotation speed, ranging from 1 to 10. Random Parallel: Sets a random horizontal angle limit from -180° to 180°. Random Vertical: Set a random vertical angle limit from -90° to 90°. Reset position: Restore the default view. Save location: Save the current view and load it automatically the next time you visit the grid. Update preview: Refresh the camera cover image and use it as a playback mode preview."
